WEBVTT

00:24:00.371 --> 00:24:03.045
You know, I like to believe
he believed it.

00:24:07.797 --> 00:24:09.962
I know that the team believed it.

00:24:12.804 --> 00:24:16.802
And that as a workforce, and as a team,

00:24:16.826 --> 00:24:18.688
and as a culture we believed it.

00:24:20.200 --> 00:24:22.310
The question I'm kind of curious about,

00:24:22.334 --> 00:24:26.498
and curious on your take on is like,

00:24:26.522 --> 00:24:30.543
how much does a belief system
matter to a culture,